  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restoration of the Church of Maria Magdalena in Totogalpa (Phase 3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">One of the oldest colonial buildings and the second-oldest church in Nicaragua, the Church of Maria Magdalena is known for its distinctively Nicaraguan blend of architectural styles and serves its community variously as a church, community center, and emergency shelter. Phase 3 of this on-going project includes remedial restoration work on the tower and interior.</narrative>
  </description>
